  "question": {
    "text": "A person of mass 60 kg is inside a lift of mass 940 kg and presses the button on control panel. The lift starts moving upwards with an acceleration $1.0 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$. If $\\mathrm{g}=10 \\mathrm{~ms}^{-2}$, the tension in the supporting cable is",
    "image": null
