  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/0d0GpBirlPRzg9y8JuuDczhb1hEUncrkPPOlTg-wMXE.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nTotal mass $=(60+940) \\mathrm{kg}=1000 \\mathrm{~kg}$\nLet T be the tension in the supporting cable, then\n$T-1000 g=1000 \\times 1$\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{T}=1000 \\times 11=11000 \\mathrm{~N}$",
